. do regression_analysis.do 

. * Step 3: Regression analysis
. * Reads clean_data.csv and runs OLS regression
. 
. clear all

. set more off

. 
. program main
  1.         * Import cleaned data (relative to code/ → ../input-data/)
.         import delimited ../input-data/clean_data.csv, clear
  2. 
.         * Run simple OLS regression: y = a + b*x
.         regress y x
  3. 
.         * Display results to log
.         eststo result1
  4.         esttab result1 using ../output/regression_results.txt, replace ///
>                 cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) ///
>                 stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
>                 label title("OLS Regression: y on x")
  5. 
. end

. 
